/target
/test/
*.bak
*.narc
# ...except the compatibility fixtures. They are real archives written by an
# older build, and the test that opens them is the only thing standing between
# a change to the LZMA2 window or the PPMd7 pool and every existing archive
# becoming undecodable. Ignoring them makes that test silently vacuous.
!crates/narc-core/tests/fixtures/*.narc
/ui/node_modules
/ui/dist
/crates/narc-gui/gen
